<idea-plugin>
    <id>org.stvnadore.plugin</id>
    <name>STVN Data Grammar Language</name>
    <vendor email="jim.oflaherty.jr@gmail.com">chaotic3quilibrium</vendor>

    <change-notes><![CDATA[
      <h3>1.2.0 - 2026.09.12</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Integrated changes to `stvnadore-core`:
          <ul>
            <li>Standard prelude relocated to namespace <code>:org/stvnadore/prelude/*</code> and out of root, completely clearing the root namespace</li>
            <li>Atomic temporal primitives pruned to nominal prelude schemas</li>
            <li>Package enclosures (<code>:package</code>) with automatic LHS FQNI expansion</li>
            <li>Scoped <code>:use</code> with atomic unary <code>#strip</code> terminal slicing</li>
            <li>Hermetic flat payload tier (newly introduced <code>.stvn_f</code>) and flat schema tier (existing <code>.stvn_inclf</code>)</li>
            <li>Arbitrary bit-width integer overflow enforcement (BigInteger)</li>
            <li>Updated shared-fixtures conformance suite</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><b>STVN 1.2 Namespace &amp; Lexical Scope Architecture:</b> Introduced native grammar and editor support for <code>:package</code> enclaves and lexical import statements (<code>:use</code>) with multi-target maps, aliasing, and <code>#strip</code> modifier.</li>
        <li><b>Flat Payload Documents (<code>.stvn_f</code>):</b> Registered new <code>.stvn_f</code> file type and parser definition for detached flat payload evaluation without embedded headers.</li>
        <li><b>Prelude Standard Library Synchronization:</b> Synchronized with <code>stvnadore-core:1.2.0</code>, transitioning temporal atoms (<code>:DateTimeOffset</code>, <code>:DateTimeZoned</code>, <code>:DateTimeAudited</code>, epoch timestamps) to regex-constrained standard library prelude definitions under <code>:org/stvnadore/prelude/*</code>.</li>
        <li><b>5 New In-Editor Inspections:</b> Implemented real-time inspections for nested package declarations (<code>StvnNestedPackage</code>), trailing slashes in type definitions (<code>StvnTrailingSlash</code>), LHS reserved type keywords (<code>StvnLhsReservedType</code>), <code>:include</code> directives in flat payload documents (<code>StvnFlatDocumentInclude</code>), and out-of-order constant definitions (<code>StvnConstantRange</code>).</li>
        <li><b>Precise Error Range Clamping:</b> Clamped external compiler diagnostic ranges directly to offending AST elements across file definitions, resolving error displacement and suppressing cascading parser artifacts.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>1.1.1 - 2026.09.07</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Rule STR-04 Arrow Delimiter Deprecation:</b> Flagged deprecated <code>"""->[TAG]</code> opening delimiter with <code>LIKE_DEPRECATED</code> strikeout diagnostic and introduced <code>Remove deprecated '-&gt;' arrow</code> quick-fix supporting whole-project batch Code Cleanup.</li>
        <li><b>Rule STR-04 Delimiter Invariants:</b> Synchronized JFlex lexer and Grammar-Kit BNF to support optional arrow syntax (<code>"""->[TAG]</code> and <code>"""[TAG]</code>), enforcing character class <code>^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,256}$</code>.</li>
        <li><b>Exact Symmetrical Suffix Scanning:</b> Implemented exact-match scanning in JFlex, ensuring arbitrary recursive nesting (e.g. CAS envelopes enclosing inner payloads) never prematurely terminates.</li>
        <li><b>Fenced String Inspection:</b> Introduced <code>StvnFencedStringInspection</code> providing real-time in-editor validation and quick-fixes for malformed opening tags, length violations, and mismatched closing delimiters.</li>
        <li><b>Comprehensive Orphan Delimiter Guard:</b> Intercepts orphan closing fences in default mode, preventing accidental block string triggering.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>1.1.0 - 2026.09.06</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Language Grammar:</b> Added grammar and lexer support for Enum Subset Filtering metadata facets (<code>#filterIncl</code> and <code>#filterExcl</code>) on nominal type aliases.</li>
        <li><b>Semantic Inspection:</b> Introduced <code>StvnEnumSubsetInspection</code> enforcing root declaration ordering, monotonic narrowing, mutual exclusivity, target attachment constraints, non-empty filter lists, and payload membership.</li>
        <li><b>In-Place Quick-Fix:</b> Implemented <code>StvnReorderEnumFilterVariantsQuickFix</code> (&quot;Sort variants to match root enum declaration order&quot;) to rewrite out-of-order filter lists automatically.</li>
        <li><b>Context-Aware Completion:</b> Enhanced <code>StvnValueCompletionContributor</code> with subset payload domain filtering and bracketed filter facet authoring that suppresses duplicate and invalid variants.</li>
        <li><b>Hover Documentation:</b> Upgraded <code>StvnDocumentationProvider</code> to display effective subset variant counts, unrolled <code>:Enum [ ... ]</code> structures, derivation lineage, and resolution paths.</li>
        <li><b>Wire Framing Protocol:</b> Integrated Byte 4 wire framing awareness in binary verification fixtures, covering Bit 7 CRC-32C trailer detection and Bits 6..4 encoding strategy sentinel <code>0x7</code> header extension handling.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>1.0.2 - 2026.09.04</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Initial General Availability release of STVN Language Support for IntelliJ 2025.3+.</li>
        <li>Full syntax highlighting for STVN primitives, compounds, and types.</li>
        <li>Compile-time diagnostics, parser verification, and test fixture support.</li>
      </ul>
    ]]></change-notes>

    <depends>com.intellij.modules.platform</depends>
    <depends>com.intellij.modules.java</depends>

    <extensions defaultExtensionNs="com.intellij">
        <!-- 1. File Type Extension Registrations -->
        <fileType name="STVN_PAYLOAD"
                  language="STVN"
                  implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnFileType$Payload"
                  fieldName="INSTANCE"
                  extensions="stvn"/>

        <fileType name="STVN_FLAT_PAYLOAD"
                  language="STVN"
                  implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnFileType$FlatPayload"
                  fieldName="INSTANCE"
                  extensions="stvn_f"/>

        <fileType name="STVN_INCL"
                  language="STVN"
                  implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnFileType$Incl"
                  fieldName="INSTANCE"
                  extensions="stvn_incl"/>

        <fileType name="STVN_INCLF"
                  language="STVN"
                  implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnFileType$Inclf"
                  fieldName="INSTANCE"
                  extensions="stvn_inclf"/>

        <!-- 2. Core Parser Definition -->
        <lang.parserDefinition language="STVN"
                               implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnParserDefinition"/>

        <!-- 2b. Line Commenter -->
        <lang.commenter language="STVN"
                        implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.lang.StvnCommenter"/>

        <!-- 2c. Enter Handler for Fenced String Delimiters -->
        <enterHandlerDelegate implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.editor.StvnEnterInFencedStringHandler"/>

        <!-- 2d. Typed Handler for Bracket Auto-Pairing in Fenced Strings -->
        <typedHandler implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.editor.StvnFencedStringTypedHandler"/>

        <!-- 2e. Rename Handler for Balanced Fenced String Delimiter Tags -->
        <renameHandler implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.editor.StvnFencedStringTagRenameHandler"/>

        <!-- 3. Annotator for downstream tag parity semantic checks -->
        <annotator language="STVN"
                   implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnSemanticAnnotator"/>

        <!-- 4. Syntax Highlighting & Coloring -->
        <lang.syntaxHighlighterFactory language="STVN"
                                       implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnSyntaxHighlighterFactory"/>

        <colorSettingsPage implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.StvnColorSettingsPage"/>

        <!-- 4b. Native Formatter & Code Style Providers -->
        <lang.formatter language="STVN"
                        implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.formatting.StvnFormattingModelBuilder"/>

        <codeStyleSettingsProvider
                implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.formatting.StvnCodeStyleSettingsProvider"/>

        <langCodeStyleSettingsProvider
                implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.formatting.StvnLanguageCodeStyleSettingsProvider"/>

        <!-- 5. Real-time Compiler Diagnostics Bridge -->
        <externalAnnotator language="STVN"
                           implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnExternalAnnotator"/>

        <!-- 5b. Project View Problem Highlighter Filter -->
        <problemFileHighlightFilter implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnProblemFileHighlightFilter"/>

        <!-- 5c. Grammar-Kit PSI Error Element Suppressor -->
        <highlightErrorFilter implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnHighlightErrorFilter"/>

        <!-- 6. Find Usages Support -->
        <lang.findUsagesProvider language="STVN"
                                 implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.findusages.StvnFindUsagesProvider"/>

        <!-- 6b. Goto Symbol Navigation -->
        <chooseByNameContributor implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.reference.StvnChooseByNameContributor"/>

        <!-- 6c. PSI Reference Contributor -->
        <psi.referenceContributor language="STVN"
                                  implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.reference.StvnReferenceContributor"/>

        <!-- 7. Inlay Hints Provider -->
        <codeInsight.inlayProvider
                language="STVN"
                implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.hints.StvnTypeInlayHintsProvider"/>

        <!-- 7b. Code Completion Contributor -->
        <completion.contributor
                language="STVN"
                implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.completion.StvnValueCompletionContributor"/>

        <!-- 8. Project-Scoped Settings Component -->
        <projectService serviceImplementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnProjectSettings"/>
        <projectService serviceImplementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnSettings"/>
        <projectService serviceImplementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnRepositorySettings"/>

        <projectConfigurable groupId="language"
                             instance="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnConfigurable"
                             id="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnConfigurable"
                             displayName="STVN"
                             icon="/icons/stvn_icon.svg"/>

        <projectConfigurable parentId="tools"
                             instance="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnRepositorySettingsConfigurable"
                             id="org.stvnadore.plugin.settings.StvnRepositorySettingsConfigurable"
                             displayName="STVN Schema Repository"
                             nonDefaultProject="false"/>

        <!-- 9. Documentation Provider -->
        <lang.documentationProvider language="STVN"
                                    implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.documentation.StvnDocumentationProvider"/>

        <!-- 10. Local Inspection for Variant tag style -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnVariantStyle"
                         displayName="Variant tag style inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Style"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="WARNING"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnVariantStyleInspection"/>

        <!-- 11. Local Inspection for Boolean validity -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnBooleanValidity"
                         displayName="Boolean validity inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Validity"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnBooleanValidityInspection"/>

        <!-- 12. Local Inspection for Flat list in map slot -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnMapStructural"
                         displayName="Flat list in map slot inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Structural"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnMapStructuralInspection"/>

        <!-- 12b. Local Inspection for Degraded Schemas -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnDegradedSchema"
                         displayName="Degraded schema payload evaluation"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Quality &amp; Semantics"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="WEAK WARNING"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnDegradedSchemaInspection"/>

        <!-- 12c. Local Inspection for Degenerate Arity-1 Composites -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnDegenerateComposite"
                         displayName="Degenerate arity-1 composite schema"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Schema Design"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="WARNING"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnDegenerateCompositeInspection"/>

        <!-- 12d. Local Inspection for Enum Subset Filtering -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnEnumSubset"
                         displayName="Enum subset filtering inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Semantics"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnEnumSubsetInspection"/>

        <!-- 12e. Local Inspection for Fenced String Delimiters (Rule STR-04) -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnFencedString"
                         displayName="Fenced string delimiter inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Syntax"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         cleanupTool="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnFencedStringInspection"/>

        <!-- 12f. Local Inspection for LHS Reserved Types -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnLhsReservedType"
                         displayName="LHS reserved type inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Semantics"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnLhsReservedTypeInspection"/>

        <!-- 12g. Local Inspection for Constant Integer Range -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnConstantRange"
                         displayName="Constant integer range inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Validity"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnConstantRangeInspection"/>

        <!-- 12h. Local Inspection for Flat Document Includes -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnFlatDocumentInclude"
                         displayName="Flat document include inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Structural"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnFlatDocumentIncludeInspection"/>

        <!-- 12i. Local Inspection for Nested Package Enclosures -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnNestedPackage"
                         displayName="Nested package inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Structural"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnNestedPackageInspection"/>

        <!-- 12j. Local Inspection for Trailing Slashes in :use Targets -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnTrailingSlash"
                         displayName="Trailing slash inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Syntax"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="ERROR"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnTrailingSlashInspection"/>

        <!-- 12k. Local Inspection for String Capacity Governance -->
        <localInspection language="STVN"
                         shortName="StvnStringCapacity"
                         displayName="String capacity governance inspection"
                         groupPath="STVN"
                         groupName="Governance"
                         enabledByDefault="true"
                         level="WARNING"
                         implementationClass="org.stvnadore.plugin.validation.StvnStringCapacityInspection"/>

        <!-- 13. Notification Group for Workspace compilation alerts -->
        <notificationGroup id="STVN Workspace Group" displayType="BALLOON"/>

        <!-- 13b. Notification Group for STVN Repository Client Alerts -->
        <notificationGroup id="STVN Repository Group" displayType="BALLOON"/>

        <!-- 13c. Live Templates -->
        <defaultLiveTemplates file="liveTemplates/STVN.xml"/>
        <liveTemplateContext contextId="STVN" implementation="org.stvnadore.plugin.templates.StvnTemplateContextType"/>

        <!-- 13d. Intention Action for Bare Triple-Quote to Fenced String Block -->
        <intentionAction>
            <className>org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnCreateFencedStringIntention</className>
            <category>STVN</category>
            <description>Convert bare triple-quote string to fenced string block</description>
        </intentionAction>

        <!-- 14. Schema-Driven Skeleton Generator Intention Action -->
        <intentionAction>
            <className>org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnSchemaSkeletonIntentionAction</className>
            <category>STVN</category>
            <description>Scaffolds canonical data templates from resolved document schemas</description>
        </intentionAction>

    </extensions>

    <actions>
        <action id="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnFlattenWorkspaceAction"
                class="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnFlattenWorkspaceAction"
                text="Flatten STVN Workspace"
                description="Resolves workspace dependencies and exports a canonical stripped .stvn_inclf file">
            <add-to-group group-id="ProjectViewPopupMenu" anchor="after" relative-to-action="WeighingAction"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="BuildMenu" anchor="last"/>
        </action>

        <action id="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.PublishSchemaAction"
                class="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.PublishSchemaAction"
                text="Publish Schema to STVN Repository"
                description="Publishes flattened STVN schema to the configured remote STVN Schema Repository"
                icon="/icons/stvn_icon.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="ProjectViewPopupMenu" anchor="after" relative-to-action="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnFlattenWorkspaceAction"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="EditorPopupMenu" anchor="last"/>
        </action>

        <group id="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnEditorPopupMenu"
               text="STVN"
               description="STVN data projection and formatting actions"
               popup="true">
            <add-to-group group-id="EditorPopupMenu" anchor="last"/>
            <action id="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnConvertToPrettyPrintAction"
                    class="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnConvertToPrettyPrintAction"
                    text="STVN: Convert to Pretty Print"
                    description="Formats active STVN document with 2-space indentation and long-form symbols"/>
            <action id="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnConvertToCompactPrintAction"
                    class="org.stvnadore.plugin.actions.StvnConvertToCompactPrintAction"
                    text="STVN: Convert to Compact Print"
                    description="Formats active STVN document into compact single-line layout with short-form symbols"/>
        </group>
    </actions>
</idea-plugin>
